# The name, not the face (docs/REPUTATION.md, "The season record"): a new life is a new face, but
# the season record keeps the name an earlier life made. Once a life per leader. And a lie that was
# caught or found out (nmem:lied): the speaker's next greeting says so, once.

conv haven.leader.name
for leader:haven
when seasoned:haven & !met
greet
once
prio reaction
voice haven

node start
  say "I don't know the face. I know the name. {title:haven}, wasn't it? Sit. Faces change. Soup doesn't."

conv bastion.leader.name
for leader:bastion
when seasoned:bastion & !met
greet
once
prio reaction
voice bastion

node start
  say "Don't know the face. Know the name. It's in the file as {title:bastion}. New face, same file."

conv redhand.leader.name
for leader:redhand
when seasoned:redhand & !met
greet
once
prio reaction
voice redhand

node start
  say "Don't know the face. Know the name, though. The book never forgets a name. Faces, all the time."

conv halcyon.leader.name
for leader:halcyon
when seasoned:halcyon & !met
greet
once
prio reaction
voice halcyon

node start
  say "Different face. Same name in the record: {title:halcyon}. We'll treat it as a repeat measurement."

conv haven.leader.lied
for leader:haven
when nmem:lied
greet
once
prio quest
voice haven

node start
  say "You told me something that wasn't true. I found out. I'm not angry. I'm just counting differently now."

conv bastion.leader.lied
for leader:bastion
when nmem:lied
greet
once
prio quest
voice bastion

node start
  say "What you told me didn't check out. It's in your file now. Next to the other things."

conv redhand.leader.lied
for leader:redhand
when nmem:lied
greet
once
prio quest
voice redhand

node start
  say "You lied to me. To me! In my own camp. I'd be impressed if I wasn't writing it down."

conv halcyon.leader.lied
for leader:halcyon
when nmem:lied
greet
once
prio quest
voice halcyon

node start
  say "Your account didn't replicate. The discrepancy is in the record, with your initials."

conv wanderer.deserter.picture
for wanderer:deserter
when tier:bastion!=stranger
topic "Ask what Bastion makes of you."
prio flavour
daily
voice plain

node start
  say? rep:bastion=necessary_evil :: "Bastion's got you as a Necessary Evil. Means they'll use you till you're used up. Ask me how I know."
  say? rep:bastion=useful_trouble :: "Useful Trouble. They'll smile at you and log it. Both, every time."
  say? hunted:bastion :: "Hunted. Welcome to the club. There's no club. There's a ditch and a lot of looking over your shoulder."
  say? tier:bastion>=trusted :: "They trust you. I was trusted once. It's a lovely feeling until they read you an order."
  say "They've got you on a board somewhere, in chalk. Chalk rubs out. Remember that."
  > @why "Why did you leave?" -> why
  > @back "Something else." -> hub

node why
  say "Same reason anyone leaves. Somebody read out an order and I heard it properly for once."
  > @back1 "Something else." -> hub

conv table.road.exile
for table:road
when exiled & !table:crossed
greet
once
voice table

node start
  say "Put out, were you? The houses do that. Counting, always counting. We don't count. We just make room."
